 "_comment": "T-FINANCE: the third real anomaly-detection graph and the eighth overall. The\ntwo-regime law was written after Amazon falsified the one-regime form and owes\nits own out-of-sample test (METHODOLOGY 6.3, threat 10.1-6); the PL-on-real-data\nclaim rests on n=2 (Yelp harmful, Amazon null). Predictions P26-P28 are in\nanalysis/tables/prediction_tfinance.md, written from the training-free\ndiagnostic before any of these ran.\n\nConfig is Yelp's block verbatim except input_dim=10 (untuned by design, as\nAmazon); the SimSample arm is chosen on validation from A_sim1.0 / A_sim0.0.\nC_nopl runs under BOTH arms so the decomposition is available for whichever\nvalidation picks. DEMO is the full published method with an APPNP PPR\n(analysis/scripts/make_ppr.py --dataset tfinance, 6.2 GB). NSReg from its\nreleased code. Per-node scores saved for the per-class law test.",
